  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HALO Syria Earthquake Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On February 6, earthquakes devastated Syria and Turkey, causing thousands of casualties and displacing tens of thousand. HALO is working in NW Syria with the Syria Civil Defence and using our excavator, usually used for landmine clearance, to help excavate people trapped from the rubble. The huge levels of additional displaced people makes the landmine crisis even more dangerous, and HALO is on call to respond and destroy landmines &amp; explosives to keep displaced families and aid workers safe.</narrative>
  </description>
